1
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:08,020
Hold my hand until I fall asleep.

2
00:00:10,530 --> 00:00:14,450
<i>I guess I was the one 
who called the ceasefire.</i>

3
00:00:14,450 --> 00:00:18,990
<i>And it's not like she's ever 
this honest with herself.</i>

4
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,000
All right, fine.

5
00:00:21,410 --> 00:00:22,500
Until you fall asleep.

6
00:00:28,050 --> 00:00:29,090
Right.

7
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:32,260
I'm back.

8
00:00:35,010 --> 00:00:36,400
What are the two of you doing?

9
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:38,540
N-N-N-Nothing!

10
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:40,060
And where is the cleaner?!

11
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,150
I bought some.

12
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:42,970
But there's just one problem.

13
00:00:42,970 --> 00:00:44,880
Wh-What?

14
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:48,820
For a little while now, my chest

15
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:53,740
has been feeling strangely 
warm and bittersweet.

16
00:00:53,740 --> 00:00:58,810
I interpret this as 
your emotions flowing into me.

17
00:00:59,370 --> 00:01:02,200
So, what were the two of you doing?

18
00:01:03,150 --> 00:01:04,510
Lily-sama?!

19
00:01:27,410 --> 00:01:29,270
Utterly useless.

20
00:01:29,940 --> 00:01:33,010
Though she did defeat my snakes...

21
00:01:33,010 --> 00:01:35,430
Was she always that powerful?

22
00:01:36,060 --> 00:01:37,390
Now I'm curious.

23
00:01:38,690 --> 00:01:41,680
You, go take a look.

24
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:43,740
We won't get approval.

25
00:01:43,740 --> 00:01:45,170
It's fine.

26
00:01:45,170 --> 00:01:47,410
I'll make the request.

27
00:01:47,410 --> 00:01:50,410
Very well, Sister.

28
00:01:56,460 --> 00:01:58,810
Come on, what are you waiting for?

29
00:01:58,810 --> 00:02:01,680
It's another beautiful day of demon hunting.

30
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:03,780
This soon after your recovery?

31
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:07,140
I need no rest.

32
00:02:07,140 --> 00:02:09,060
Why don't we have something to eat first?

33
00:02:09,060 --> 00:02:10,940
I shall treat you to thank you for visiting me.

34
00:02:10,940 --> 00:02:11,720
Really?

35
00:02:11,720 --> 00:02:12,650
Indeed.

36
00:02:12,650 --> 00:02:14,140
What should I ask for?

37
00:02:14,140 --> 00:02:15,630
I think I should go with boiled gyoza.

38
00:02:15,630 --> 00:02:17,000
Fried, then.

39
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:19,870
I finally found you.

40
00:02:21,210 --> 00:02:25,890
You seem to be enjoying yourself, Lily.

41
00:02:30,300 --> 00:02:32,460
Nii-sama...

42
00:04:06,980 --> 00:04:10,680
<i>This hot guy is Amane-san's brother?</i>

43
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:12,520
<i>Which has to mean...</i>

44
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:14,010
<i>He's an angel!</i>

45
00:04:16,270 --> 00:04:17,320
And you?

46
00:04:19,780 --> 00:04:23,530
I-I'm... Er, I'm just, well...

47
00:04:25,940 --> 00:04:27,490
He's Akutsu-kun.

48
00:04:28,790 --> 00:04:30,790
My classmate.

49
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:34,870
We bumped into each other in town, 
so we've been chatting for a bit.

50
00:04:36,010 --> 00:04:37,300
<i>I'm saved.</i>

51
00:04:37,300 --> 00:04:39,320
A classmate, huh?

52
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:41,220
I should introduce myself, then.

53
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:43,470
Pleased to meet you.

54
00:04:43,470 --> 00:04:44,930
I'm Zwei.

55
00:04:44,930 --> 00:04:47,540
It sounds like you've been 
a good friend to my sister.

56
00:04:47,540 --> 00:04:51,210
I hope you'll continue to be one. Thank you.

57
00:04:52,730 --> 00:04:54,690
R-Right.

58
00:04:58,070 --> 00:05:00,110
Th-Thank you, too.

59
00:05:00,110 --> 00:05:05,910
Now, I hate to interrupt your conversation, 
but may I borrow my sister for a while?

60
00:05:06,490 --> 00:05:07,540
O-Okay.

61
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:09,850
It's been a while since we last met.

62
00:05:09,850 --> 00:05:12,330
I'd like for us to have a family moment.

63
00:05:12,820 --> 00:05:13,660
Sure.

64
00:05:14,820 --> 00:05:16,010
My apologies.

65
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:18,420
Let's go, Lily.

66
00:05:19,050 --> 00:05:22,690
Well, bye-bye, Akutsu-kun.

67
00:05:36,620 --> 00:05:38,350
<i>I'm exhausted.</i>

68
00:05:38,350 --> 00:05:40,600
<i>I didn't know she had a brother.</i>

69
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:42,820
<i>I got so tense, I let myself sound subservient.</i>

70
00:05:43,150 --> 00:05:45,260
<i>Good thing I didn't accidentally reveal myself.</i>

71
00:05:45,260 --> 00:05:48,210
<i>It'd be a serious issue 
if he found out who I am.</i>

72
00:05:52,700 --> 00:05:54,740
<i>I survived it, boss!</i>

73
00:05:54,740 --> 00:05:55,510
<i>Yup!</i>

74
00:05:57,490 --> 00:05:59,560
A family moment, huh?

75
00:06:00,350 --> 00:06:04,000
Come to think of it, Amane seemed 
a bit awkward back there.

76
00:06:05,270 --> 00:06:07,480
Well, bye-bye, Akutsu-kun.

77
00:06:08,010 --> 00:06:10,010
Wait... could she be...

78
00:06:10,380 --> 00:06:12,960
Sheesh, you could've told me you were coming!

79
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:14,750
Wo hen jing ya!

80
00:06:14,750 --> 00:06:17,250
I have no idea what you're saying.

81
00:06:18,260 --> 00:06:22,210
<i>Maybe she got nervous because 
she's obsessed with her brother.</i>

82
00:06:23,070 --> 00:06:24,750
<i>Nah, no way.</i>

83
00:06:25,950 --> 00:06:27,870
<i>It's going to be okay, right?</i>

84
00:06:27,870 --> 00:06:29,280
<i>He's her brother.</i>

85
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:31,130
<i>I'm sure he's a nice guy.</i>

86
00:06:32,110 --> 00:06:35,460
<i>Right, Amane?</i>

87
00:06:36,760 --> 00:06:40,170
Lily, you don't need to be so nervous.

88
00:06:40,620 --> 00:06:42,960
I've put up a barrier.

89
00:06:42,960 --> 00:06:44,920
No one will come near.

90
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:47,610
Oh, but from a distance...

91
00:06:48,250 --> 00:06:50,280
They might be able to see...

92
00:06:53,250 --> 00:06:56,100
You making a fool of yourself.

93
00:06:57,210 --> 00:07:02,230
Yup, I like seeing you grovel.

94
00:07:02,730 --> 00:07:05,070
I'm surprised, though.

95
00:07:05,070 --> 00:07:07,610
I never would have thought you'd have a friend.

96
00:07:08,230 --> 00:07:10,760
Akutsu-kun, was it?

97
00:07:12,260 --> 00:07:14,970
H-He's just a classmate.

98
00:07:15,330 --> 00:07:17,700
We don't have a special relationship.

99
00:07:18,370 --> 00:07:19,630
Yeah?

100
00:07:19,630 --> 00:07:21,210
Not that I care.

101
00:07:21,550 --> 00:07:25,860
Th-That aside, what business brings you hereâ€”

102
00:07:29,900 --> 00:07:32,570
Whoa, that was close.

103
00:07:32,570 --> 00:07:34,760
You shouldn't have raised 
your head without permission.

104
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:40,310
I came close to hurting your adorable face.

105
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:45,150
I-I apologize.

106
00:07:46,110 --> 00:07:48,840
Actually, go on and raise your head.

107
00:07:48,840 --> 00:07:51,050
It's easier to talk that way.

108
00:07:51,900 --> 00:07:54,410
I'm here on behalf of Nee-san.

109
00:07:55,090 --> 00:07:57,910
I came to this side to ask you a question.

110
00:07:57,910 --> 00:08:02,920
How did you defeat the avatar 
that our sister blessed?

111
00:08:05,550 --> 00:08:06,620
Sheesh.

112
00:08:06,620 --> 00:08:09,130
It would have been easier to just disable it.

113
00:08:09,410 --> 00:08:10,920
You lousy demon!

114
00:08:15,930 --> 00:08:17,520
I knew it. Snakes.

115
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:20,540
It's my avatar, and I'm taking it back!

116
00:08:28,440 --> 00:08:31,100
I'm not surprised you removed the blessing,

117
00:08:31,100 --> 00:08:34,390
but you couldn't have disabled 
the avatar so easily.

118
00:08:34,810 --> 00:08:36,370
Th-That was...

119
00:08:36,750 --> 00:08:40,020
I summoned it out of curiosity, 
and it attacked me,

120
00:08:40,020 --> 00:08:44,100
so I fought it desperately, 
disabled it, and removed the blessing.

121
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:48,670
I-I wasn't unscathed, either, of course.

122
00:08:53,140 --> 00:08:57,300
Is that really a recent wound?

123
00:08:58,780 --> 00:08:59,840
Yes.

124
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:01,890
Would you like to see it up close?

125
00:09:02,900 --> 00:09:03,890
No.

126
00:09:03,890 --> 00:09:05,290
It's fine for now.

127
00:09:05,640 --> 00:09:07,410
I see.

128
00:09:07,410 --> 00:09:09,500
By the way...

129
00:09:10,140 --> 00:09:14,130
You were sent to the human realm 
to eliminate demons, were you not?

130
00:09:14,130 --> 00:09:18,410
The demons you've been defeating 
seem to fall in a pattern, though.

131
00:09:18,410 --> 00:09:20,650
They're all beast types.

132
00:09:22,010 --> 00:09:27,260
There's no way there aren't any 
humanoid demons, even out here.

133
00:09:27,260 --> 00:09:32,990
Are you being lazy, 
or are you scheming something?

134
00:09:34,460 --> 00:09:38,220
Beast types aside, humanoids have minds.

135
00:09:38,220 --> 00:09:39,540
It's difficult.

136
00:09:39,540 --> 00:09:40,650
I see.

137
00:09:41,010 --> 00:09:43,810
I suppose that's the best you can do, then.

138
00:09:43,810 --> 00:09:44,770
Yes.

139
00:09:44,770 --> 00:09:48,040
Your sister and I have both been concerned.

140
00:09:48,490 --> 00:09:51,890
That you might be plotting something 
out of spite toward us.

141
00:09:51,890 --> 00:09:53,650
N-No...

142
00:09:53,650 --> 00:09:57,380
You know, you've been through a lot until now.

143
00:09:57,380 --> 00:09:59,520
Especially because of your sister.

144
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:02,930
So I can't help but worry.

145
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:07,040
Why would you suggest such a thing?

146
00:10:07,400 --> 00:10:12,790
You've given me work just 
like the other angels.

147
00:10:13,070 --> 00:10:14,470
I'm grateful.

148
00:10:16,370 --> 00:10:18,140
That's good to hear.

149
00:10:18,140 --> 00:10:19,800
Sorry to doubt you.

150
00:10:20,220 --> 00:10:21,430
Now, then...

151
00:10:21,700 --> 00:10:23,310
I've heard all I need to hear.

152
00:10:23,310 --> 00:10:25,740
I suppose I'll go home and report to Nee-san.

153
00:10:25,740 --> 00:10:28,890
Well, keep up the good work.

154
00:10:29,570 --> 00:10:32,270
Th-Thank you.

155
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:36,030
One last question...

156
00:10:36,290 --> 00:10:40,010
You tried summoning your avatar 
and lost control, correct?

157
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:41,820
Yes.

158
00:10:45,070 --> 00:10:47,870
Nee-san really loves mischief.

159
00:10:49,350 --> 00:10:55,580
She said it was a trap to make sure 
you'd struggle when you fought.

160
00:10:57,770 --> 00:10:59,220
A trap?

161
00:10:59,630 --> 00:11:02,880
And there was a condition 
that would activate the trap.

162
00:11:02,880 --> 00:11:08,100
That condition was that there be a
demon nearby when you summoned it.

163
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:16,900
In other words, you were with a demon.

164
00:11:19,010 --> 00:11:21,660
Lily-sama, I'm coming!

165
00:11:26,710 --> 00:11:28,730
No more of this, Lily.

166
00:11:29,150 --> 00:11:31,940
Don't underestimate me.

167
00:11:32,680 --> 00:11:34,850
Depending on your answer...

168
00:11:34,850 --> 00:11:36,380
You know what'll happen.

169
00:11:36,380 --> 00:11:37,550
<i>I'm scared.</i>

170
00:11:38,260 --> 00:11:40,170
Who's the demon?

171
00:11:40,170 --> 00:11:41,180
<i>I'm scared.</i>

172
00:11:41,180 --> 00:11:44,220
What are you hiding?

173
00:11:44,220 --> 00:11:46,670
<i>Someone help me.</i>

174
00:11:47,220 --> 00:11:48,580
<i>Akutsu!</i>

175
00:11:57,130 --> 00:11:59,110
<i>That was close.</i>

176
00:11:59,110 --> 00:12:01,510
<i>I was about to charge in.</i>

177
00:12:02,890 --> 00:12:04,910
<i>Just what is going on?</i>

178
00:12:04,910 --> 00:12:06,940
<i>Isn't he her brother?</i>

179
00:12:06,940 --> 00:12:09,910
<i>I can't believe she'd be 
pinned down so easily, though.</i>

180
00:12:10,290 --> 00:12:12,530
<i>He's an even more capable 
angel than she is, then.</i>

181
00:12:17,460 --> 00:12:19,480
<i>I'm sorry, Amane.</i>

182
00:12:23,170 --> 00:12:26,600
<i>But his mercilessness, even towards a woman...</i>

183
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:29,380
<i>He's a textbook angel.</i>

184
00:12:30,740 --> 00:12:31,610
<i>Hi.</i>

185
00:12:31,610 --> 00:12:33,440
<i>What's up, Akutsu?</i>

186
00:12:33,710 --> 00:12:36,130
<i>I'd forgotten after I'd spent 
so much time with her...</i>

187
00:12:39,870 --> 00:12:43,530
<i>Angels are cruel and inhumane.</i>

188
00:12:43,530 --> 00:12:46,010
<i>Hello? Are you listening?</i>

189
00:12:46,010 --> 00:12:47,200
<i>So is she.</i>

190
00:12:53,380 --> 00:12:54,390
<i>No...</i>

191
00:12:54,390 --> 00:12:56,390
<i>What am I thinking?</i>

192
00:12:56,390 --> 00:12:58,980
<i>It's in her nature. 
She wouldn't be any different.</i>

193
00:12:58,980 --> 00:13:01,260
<i>Amane's still an angel, after all.</i>

194
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:03,760
<i>Yeah, just...</i>

195
00:13:03,760 --> 00:13:05,880
<i>Akutsu? Is something wrong?</i>

196
00:13:06,220 --> 00:13:08,530
Yes, I'm listening.

197
00:13:08,530 --> 00:13:10,760
I just discovered an angel.

198
00:13:11,450 --> 00:13:12,740
Yes.

199
00:13:12,740 --> 00:13:14,770
I'm not an idiot.

200
00:13:14,770 --> 00:13:16,860
I wouldn't fight alone.

201
00:13:17,780 --> 00:13:18,670
Yes.

202
00:13:18,670 --> 00:13:20,660
I'll get as far away as I can.

203
00:13:20,660 --> 00:13:21,570
Or...

204
00:13:21,570 --> 00:13:23,490
So I wish I could say!

205
00:13:28,410 --> 00:13:29,620
What's this?

206
00:13:30,780 --> 00:13:32,650
Oh, er...

207
00:13:32,650 --> 00:13:34,120
I regret to inform you...

208
00:13:36,110 --> 00:13:37,580
Akutsu?

209
00:13:37,920 --> 00:13:39,650
I've been found.

210
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:42,290
Pardon me.

211
00:13:43,090 --> 00:13:45,420
Akutsu-kun, was it?

212
00:13:45,420 --> 00:13:47,060
We meet again.

213
00:13:47,060 --> 00:13:49,050
Where did you even come from?

214
00:13:49,390 --> 00:13:50,320
<i>Now what?</i>

215
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:52,140
<i>I couldn't help but jump out.</i>

216
00:13:52,140 --> 00:13:53,930
<i>I need to distract him somehow.</i>

217
00:13:54,300 --> 00:13:56,650
You've been watching from up there, huh?

218
00:13:57,470 --> 00:14:00,360
You aren't one of ours, are you?

219
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:03,230
If you were, you would have 
mentioned it earlier.

220
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:05,400
Which has to mean...

221
00:14:05,400 --> 00:14:07,230
Yeah, you must be...

222
00:14:08,340 --> 00:14:11,660
You must be the demon.

223
00:14:16,250 --> 00:14:17,960
That face...

224
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:19,620
I thought so.

225
00:14:21,730 --> 00:14:24,580
You're the demon that was there that day.

226
00:14:24,580 --> 00:14:27,260
Lily, you lied to me.

227
00:14:27,260 --> 00:14:29,680
You're going to need punishment.

228
00:14:29,680 --> 00:14:31,550
Nii-sama!

229
00:14:31,550 --> 00:14:33,630
But first...

230
00:14:35,370 --> 00:14:36,810
Demon hunting.

231
00:14:39,750 --> 00:14:41,480
<i>He's in a whole different league.</i>

232
00:14:41,770 --> 00:14:42,960
<i>Now what?</i>

233
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:45,070
<i>How do I save Amane?</i>

234
00:14:46,540 --> 00:14:47,430
Amane!

235
00:14:48,140 --> 00:14:49,700
Why did you come here?!

236
00:14:49,700 --> 00:14:52,070
You've ruined everything!

237
00:14:52,990 --> 00:14:54,580
I couldn't bear to watch.

238
00:14:54,580 --> 00:14:56,550
Well, bear it, fool!

239
00:14:56,550 --> 00:14:58,330
It's all over now.

240
00:14:58,640 --> 00:15:01,240
I'll be interrogated, and you...

241
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:02,400
And you...

242
00:15:02,400 --> 00:15:04,840
This is the one thing I wanted to avoid!

243
00:15:05,790 --> 00:15:09,750
I only had to tolerate this for a while!

244
00:15:10,220 --> 00:15:12,060
What could I do?

245
00:15:12,060 --> 00:15:13,960
My body moved on its own.

246
00:15:14,430 --> 00:15:15,560
Besides...

247
00:15:16,910 --> 00:15:20,360
I hate seeing you cry.

248
00:15:21,450 --> 00:15:22,650
You idiot!

249
00:15:25,770 --> 00:15:27,890
We just need to have your brother leave

250
00:15:27,890 --> 00:15:31,000
without my having to kill him, right?

251
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:32,400
My brother?

252
00:15:32,400 --> 00:15:34,160
You don't stand a chance.

253
00:15:34,160 --> 00:15:37,120
Let alone when you can 
only use half your power...

254
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:39,820
Just watch me.

255
00:15:40,580 --> 00:15:42,210
You're amusing.

256
00:15:42,210 --> 00:15:44,250
I like you.

257
00:15:44,250 --> 00:15:46,290
It's too bad you're a demon.

258
00:15:46,290 --> 00:15:50,010
Well, I suppose I'll give you a chance, then.

259
00:15:50,420 --> 00:15:55,640
If you can land even one hit on me, 
I'll pretend I never saw anything.

260
00:15:56,260 --> 00:15:58,090
Why, thank you.

261
00:15:58,090 --> 00:15:59,220
<i>Who does he think I am?</i>

262
00:15:59,220 --> 00:16:00,620
Okay.

263
00:16:00,620 --> 00:16:02,060
Well, let's start!

264
00:16:03,500 --> 00:16:04,480
Here!

265
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:07,850
Got you!

266
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:14,160
<i>He's nasty!</i>

267
00:16:14,160 --> 00:16:16,120
<i>And that saber is a nuisance!</i>

268
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:19,830
You won't get anywhere with guts alone.

269
00:16:21,710 --> 00:16:24,040
Looks like you've got a little fight in you.

270
00:16:25,500 --> 00:16:29,050
What an interesting demon.

271
00:16:29,540 --> 00:16:31,460
Come, Quartet.

272
00:16:38,760 --> 00:16:40,780
Who are these people?!

273
00:16:40,780 --> 00:16:43,230
My adorable avatars.

274
00:16:43,230 --> 00:16:46,500
I guess there isn't much to you after all.

275
00:16:46,500 --> 00:16:48,400
You...

276
00:16:49,580 --> 00:16:51,690
<i>I can't move!</i>

277
00:16:51,690 --> 00:16:53,180
Just give up.

278
00:16:53,180 --> 00:16:54,530
Yup, yup.

279
00:16:54,530 --> 00:16:55,930
Don't bother.

280
00:16:55,930 --> 00:16:57,650
You're a stubborn one.

281
00:16:57,650 --> 00:16:58,750
You can't win.

282
00:16:58,750 --> 00:17:01,120
They're basically copies of me.

283
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:02,250
Now...

284
00:17:02,250 --> 00:17:06,670
I could exorcise you right away, 
but that would be no fun.

285
00:17:06,670 --> 00:17:07,580
Right!

286
00:17:07,580 --> 00:17:08,540
Yup, yup.

287
00:17:08,540 --> 00:17:09,540
Correct.

288
00:17:09,540 --> 00:17:11,090
It would be no fun.

289
00:17:11,090 --> 00:17:12,220
Lily.

290
00:17:12,590 --> 00:17:14,180
Over here.

291
00:17:14,740 --> 00:17:16,760
Y-Yes.

292
00:17:17,500 --> 00:17:18,700
Don't go!

293
00:17:20,670 --> 00:17:22,870
We were in the middle of talking.

294
00:17:23,690 --> 00:17:25,810
Now, why don't you tell me...

295
00:17:25,810 --> 00:17:29,150
How did you get that demon on your side?

296
00:17:29,450 --> 00:17:31,230
Did you seduce him?

297
00:17:31,230 --> 00:17:32,330
No.

298
00:17:32,330 --> 00:17:34,150
I-I...

299
00:17:34,150 --> 00:17:36,110
Yes, I suppose you wouldn't.

300
00:17:36,500 --> 00:17:39,160
Not with your disgusting body.

301
00:17:39,620 --> 00:17:42,160
Wh-What are you talking about?

302
00:17:42,420 --> 00:17:44,480
You really don't know, do you?

303
00:17:44,480 --> 00:17:45,800
What do you say, Lily...

304
00:17:45,800 --> 00:17:49,290
Why don't you tell him, 
as your final offering?

305
00:17:49,710 --> 00:17:51,460
No...

306
00:17:51,460 --> 00:17:52,750
Anything but that.

307
00:17:54,540 --> 00:17:56,010
Please spare me.

308
00:17:58,090 --> 00:17:59,090
Nope.

309
00:18:07,900 --> 00:18:09,270
No!

310
00:18:09,270 --> 00:18:10,160
Huh?

311
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:12,150
That's odd.

312
00:18:12,530 --> 00:18:14,380
What the hell are you doing?!

313
00:18:14,380 --> 00:18:16,060
You call yourself her brother?!

314
00:18:16,060 --> 00:18:17,700
Shut up.

315
00:18:17,700 --> 00:18:19,910
You don't know anything, do you?

316
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:23,410
I'm educating you, so be quiet for a second.

317
00:18:25,750 --> 00:18:28,520
Oh, I see what you're doing.

318
00:18:28,520 --> 00:18:30,210
You're so clever, Lily.

319
00:18:30,210 --> 00:18:31,700
Move your hands.

320
00:18:33,470 --> 00:18:35,840
Otherwise, I'll take them off, too.

321
00:18:41,560 --> 00:18:43,410
Good girl.

322
00:18:55,060 --> 00:18:58,560
You were hiding it by weaving 
your chains in lightly.

323
00:18:58,560 --> 00:19:00,910
You really are clever.

324
00:19:01,510 --> 00:19:02,460
Don't look.

325
00:19:02,910 --> 00:19:06,230
Please, Akutsu.

326
00:19:06,660 --> 00:19:11,210
She has this crest wrapped 
around her entire body.

327
00:19:11,210 --> 00:19:12,790
Isn't that hilarious?

328
00:19:13,100 --> 00:19:15,080
<i>It's not funny at all.</i>

329
00:19:15,490 --> 00:19:18,330
<i>In fact, it's infuriating.</i>

330
00:19:18,950 --> 00:19:22,450
<i>I won't be satisfied until I beat the shit 
out of this damn brother of hers!</i>

331
00:19:22,970 --> 00:19:25,310
Why don't I ask you, too, then?

332
00:19:25,310 --> 00:19:28,120
Why are you hanging out with Lily?

333
00:19:28,120 --> 00:19:30,300
You're a demon, and she's your enemy.

334
00:19:30,300 --> 00:19:34,200
Not to mention, she's a wingless.

335
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:35,730
A wingless?

336
00:19:38,480 --> 00:19:40,450
What the hell are you talking about?

337
00:19:40,450 --> 00:19:41,990
She has wings!

338
00:19:41,990 --> 00:19:44,910
Oh? You've seen them, then.

339
00:19:44,910 --> 00:19:46,530
You've seen Lily's wings.

340
00:19:48,740 --> 00:19:51,210
Lily, show him.

341
00:19:52,590 --> 00:19:54,430
You heard me, didn't you?

342
00:19:56,660 --> 00:19:58,490
Nii-sama...

343
00:19:59,890 --> 00:20:01,470
Show him.

344
00:20:21,130 --> 00:20:23,490
Well done.

345
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:30,950
What's so funny?!

346
00:20:32,340 --> 00:20:33,560
I see.

347
00:20:34,060 --> 00:20:36,670
You never knew, huh?

348
00:20:37,040 --> 00:20:40,970
Wings are a symbol of an angel's power.

349
00:20:46,050 --> 00:20:46,920
Hey!

350
00:20:46,920 --> 00:20:47,890
You!

351
00:20:47,890 --> 00:20:48,770
Son of a...

352
00:20:48,770 --> 00:20:49,760
Let me go!

353
00:20:49,760 --> 00:20:51,100
I told you not to bother.

354
00:20:51,100 --> 00:20:51,950
Yup, yup.

355
00:20:51,950 --> 00:20:52,960
You're so persistent.

356
00:20:52,960 --> 00:20:54,310
You are.

357
00:20:54,310 --> 00:20:57,060
Run, Amane!

358
00:21:06,530 --> 00:21:09,060
In other words...

359
00:21:10,170 --> 00:21:12,120
She's a fraud.

360
00:21:15,720 --> 00:21:17,290
You!

361
00:21:17,290 --> 00:21:19,540
You don't learn, do you?

362
00:21:19,890 --> 00:21:22,660
You aren't going to escape from them.

363
00:21:22,660 --> 00:21:23,720
Yup, yup.

364
00:21:23,720 --> 00:21:24,550
Shit!

365
00:21:25,540 --> 00:21:28,470
Those are practically bird feathers.

366
00:21:29,140 --> 00:21:31,720
You took the texts way too seriously.

367
00:21:32,350 --> 00:21:33,510
Have a look.

368
00:21:39,390 --> 00:21:41,540
Totally different.

369
00:21:43,670 --> 00:21:45,990
<i>How far do you need to go?</i>

370
00:21:48,250 --> 00:21:54,900
<i>You dashed her pride, humiliated her, and...</i>

371
00:22:04,070 --> 00:22:05,780
<i>Tarnished her!</i>

